cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Notes from a Lean formalization of Navier-Stokes local regularity theory:
  claim scope, an independent audit, a methods note, and one open statement
type: software
message: >-
  If you refer to these notes, please cite them as below. Note the claim scope:
  this work does not prove epsilon-regularity, partial regularity, or anything
  bearing on the Clay Millennium Prize problem.
